  "description": "15 August 2025 - Weekly Wrap Up",
  "body_html": "<p>We had a fairly decent week in the markets. Made 8.3% with Ebay, and have been watching Rigetti and Lemonade stock perform well, reaching 9.2% and 16.1% respectively. Those positions are still fine, but its no mystery, the market did take a dump this morning. I’m not to concerned about it though…I don’t see anything “breaking”. Before larger scale drops, you will hear of individuals names randomly dropping -20% or -30% (or more!). VIX remains within tolerable range. Market surged hard on Wednesday and Thursday, so seeing a Friday sell off from short term traders, is not shocking. </p><p>Also…PLEASE STOP ASKING ME ABOUT United Health Group, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$UNH&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>. I made a video about United Health here, but this stock breaks nearly every rule in the investing handbook. Yes, Berkshire and Burry bought…I don’t care. They can wait YEARS before experiencing a win. I don’t feel like waiting years, or playing what is a statistical disadvantage.  </p><div class=\"native-video-embed\" data-component-name=\"VideoPlaceholder\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;mediaUploadId&quot;:&quot;287eba6d-dec6-4b71-be61-a90f08aebe02&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:null}\"></div><p>Also, in case you missed any of these videos from this week, be sure to check them out!</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/selling-a-stock-the-bad-croissant?r=4z8lgl\">Selling a Stock – The Bad Croissant</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/critical-stock-market-update-not?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Market Update + Not Getting Stopped out as Often</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/a-stock-to-buy-and-a-stock-to-watch?r=4z8lgl\">A Stock to Buy &amp; A Stock to Watch</a></p></li></ul><p>As always, I am available in the chat during market hours, so don’t hesitate to ping me with any questions. Have a great weekend….and thanks for stopping by! 👍</p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://www.stocktokdashboard.com/\">StockTokDashboard</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
